Package: drime-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, gir1.2-soup-3.0,
 rclone (>= 1.73), fuse3, hicolor-icon-theme, xdg-user-dirs, libglib2.0-bin,
 desktop-file-utils
Recommends: gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, packagekit, python3-apt
Description: Unofficial Drime cloud desktop app (virtual drive, sync folder, web app)
 Recreates the Drime desktop experience on Linux with rclone's native Drime
 backend: a virtual drive mounted at ~/Drime, a two-way synced ~/DrimeSync
 folder, and the Drime web app embedded in one window (WebKitGTK) together
 with status, updates and the setup wizard.
 .
 The rclone shipped by Debian and Ubuntu is too old for the Drime backend:
 install rclone 1.73 or newer from https://rclone.org/downloads/ first.
 Unofficial project, not affiliated with Drime.
